  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the stone bowl by rinsing it with hot water and drying it with a towel.",
    "In a small pan, toast the sesame seeds over medium heat for 2 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the roasted pumpkin seeds, sunflower seeds, toasted sesame seeds, Korean chili flakes, and salt.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the bowl and stir until everything is well combined.",
    "Transfer the seed and rice mixture to the preheated stone bowl.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and crushed toasted seaweed.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Be careful when handling the hot stone bowl.",
    "Traditionally, this dish is served in a dolsot, which is a type of Korean stone bowl."
